    "Two independent read-only reviews verified complete current COFF relocation populations and independent original full consumer spans. famewin rb symbol??_C@_02JKAF@rb?$AA@ maps684620..684623, wb symbol??_C@_02NGAF@wb?$AA@ maps68460C..68460F, both anchor44AE50; current2uses each match original hall_of_fame plus hof_load/hof_save originalstarts. basewin RENAME symbol??_C@_06LABA@RENAME?$AA@ maps682C70..682C77 anchor41A2B0, sole currentuse BaseWin::rename. alphanet NETCONNECT_JOIN_OR_CREATE symbol??_C@_0BK@LCOK@NETCONNECT_JOIN_OR_CREATE?$AA@ maps689240..68925A anchor4E29E0, both currentuses do_join_or_create andsetup match originalstart. Whole exact bytes include NUL; symbols are independent whole COMDATs in their own TUs.",
    "Authorize ONLY four new RECOVERY_LITERAL comments in named TUs beside ordinary existing literal uses with concise independent correspondence/evidence prose. Original and emitted storage are writable data; comments MUST say initial contents/address correspondence, NOT readonly, no alias, no other writer, runtime immutability, lifetime, retained selection or function acceptance. Anchor refers to original mapped function start, not operand instruction. Do NOT bind hallfame.jhh or jackal: one emitted pool matches multiple original starts. No generated tables/globalvariables, new exports or C++ token/body/type/API changes.",
    "New test uses installed literal_source parser and native literal/storage verifier against independently bounded real compiler objects and pinned image where useful. Host/source controls must reject wrongstart/extent/symbol/anchor or missing facts as applicable; do not invent acceptance by comparing hardcoded facts to themselves. Real current compiler/COFF analysis is coordinator-owned; workers may read qualified retained objects and image, not launch VC6. Keep all old ORIGINAL/claims/spans/history and testbaselines untouched. Coordinator fresh compile/link plus native source/mapping/reference/claim and strict binding/data observation required.",
    "Workers use apply_patch and uv host/read-only tests only in isolated checkout; no Git/native compiler/preparation/recording/framework/CLI edits. Scope beyond four comments/newtest needs coordinator permission. Candidate/destination checks and independent actual source review do not prove complete game/runtime/linked preservation or autonomous acceptance."
